---
/* Thin notice that distinguishes this prototype from verified club content. */
---

<div class="notice" role="note">
  <p class="page">
    <strong>Design prototype.</strong> No verified club content exists yet, so sections appear only
    when verified content is available. Colours and fonts are provisional. Nothing here is verified
    club content.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .notice {
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-block: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    line-height: var(--text-small--line-height);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .notice strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
